    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20459" root="سلع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْلَعُ</span></b>  A man <i>having the foot chapped,</i> or
<i>cracked:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلْعٌ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A man <i>having his
skin burned by fire so that the mark thereof is
seen upon it.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A man <i>affected with</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَص</span> [i. e. <i>leprosy,</i> particularly <i>the white, malignant kind thereof</i>]. (Mgh, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <i>Humpbacked.</i> (TA.)

